1
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:03,890
The interschool tournament is heating up.

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:09,440
In a tough situation, Ishizaki's self-sacrifice...

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:14,740
...allowed Tsubasa to equalize the game with an overhead kick.

4
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:18,620
Wakabayashi, who suffered the pain of defeat by conceding a goal...

5
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:24,960
...was able to stand back up thanks to his teammates' feelings.

6
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,210
Who the hell are you?!

7
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:28,960
I'm Misaki Taro.

8
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,670
Let's get along, Tsubasa-kun.

9
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:36,180
With Misaki Taro replacing the injured Ishizaki, the team...

10
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:39,390
...Tsubasa and the others had taken control of the game's flow.

11
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:41,060
But in the second half of extra time...

12
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:46,150
...Wakabayashi converted Taki's corner kick from Shutetsu into a goal with a powerful shot.

13
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:48,490
Not satisfied with that, Wakabayashi...

14
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:52,000
...wanted Shutetsu to score one more goal to guarantee victory, but...

15
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:54,450
...Tsubasa had not yet accepted defeat.

16
00:00:54,450 --> 00:01:00,080
Aiming to win, he and Misaki got extremely fired up.

17
00:02:30,290 --> 00:02:34,210
Episode 9
Happy End

18
00:02:30,290 --> 00:02:34,210
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

19
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:39,630
One minute of the second half has passed.

20
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:41,590
With goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun's goal...

21
00:02:41,590 --> 00:02:44,310
...Shutetsu has taken the lead once again.

22
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:48,350
Nankatsu must equalize once more.

23
00:02:48,350 --> 00:02:50,270
We will definitely close the gap!

24
00:02:50,270 --> 00:02:52,060
Yes!

25
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:55,070
That's right. The match isn't over yet.

26
00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:58,190
I will give everything to get the equalizer.

27
00:02:59,490 --> 00:03:02,870
Genzo, everything is going well right now.

28
00:03:03,950 --> 00:03:05,620
The match continues!

29
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:09,160
There will be no more extra time beyond this in the interschool tournament.

30
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:12,630
In the remaining 4 minutes...

31
00:03:12,630 --> 00:03:14,990
...can Nankatsu equalize or even take the lead?

32
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:17,670
Don't give them time to recover, get the ball back immediately!

33
00:03:17,670 --> 00:03:20,130
Tsubasa-kun will definitely get the equalizer!

34
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:21,680
Tsubasa!

35
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,220
Blast a shot!

36
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:25,140
Misaki-kun!

37
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:32,600
Expectations have soared with the chances created by this duo in extra time!

38
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,980
Shimada, mark Tsubasa!

39
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,480
Nakamoto, mark Misaki!

40
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,860
Mark both of them!

41
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:38,110
Okay!

42
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:39,940
Alright!

43
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:45,830
Wow! Tsubasa-kun sent a long pass to the wing!

44
00:03:45,830 --> 00:03:46,830
Got it.

45
00:03:47,540 --> 00:03:50,910
With Nankatsu's passing, the whole team is moving to attack!

46
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:53,370
You're amazing, kids! That's it!

47
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:57,040
Iwami-kun is quickly approaching the goal!

48
00:03:57,250 --> 00:04:00,550
But the shot will come from Tsubasa or Misaki.

49
00:04:01,050 --> 00:04:03,970
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun are approaching from both wings!

50
00:04:03,970 --> 00:04:05,090
Here they come!

51
00:04:05,090 --> 00:04:07,350
Shutetsu's defense is trying to block them.

52
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:10,100
I'm counting on you!

53
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:12,850
Iwami-kun gets past and sends a cross.

54
00:04:12,850 --> 00:04:15,600
Is it for Tsubasa-kun or Misaki-kun?

55
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:22,700
Wakabayashi-kun jumps and catches it!

56
00:04:24,450 --> 00:04:26,070
Nice move, Genzo.

57
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:28,950
You can keep this up until the end of the match.

58
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:31,160
This time Wakabayashi-kun made a great save.

59
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,250
Go!

60
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:33,580
Guys, fall back!

61
00:04:35,460 --> 00:04:37,790
Nankatsu's players are quickly retreating!

62
00:04:37,790 --> 00:04:42,800
Damn it! We're in the last minutes of extra time and they still aren't tired!

63
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:45,590
Where were they hiding this energy?!

64
00:04:45,590 --> 00:04:48,390
Oh no! They're going to do the birdcage again!

65
00:04:48,390 --> 00:04:49,600
What? Birdcage?

66
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:53,020
The birdcage doesn't interest us anymore!

67
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:54,270
We're after another goal!

68
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:55,850
We'll guarantee victory!

69
00:04:55,850 --> 00:04:56,690
Exactly!

70
00:04:56,690 --> 00:04:58,860
Show the greatness of Shutetsu!

71
00:04:58,860 --> 00:04:59,900
Kisugi!

72
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:03,400
Now the ball is with top scorer Kisugi-kun!

73
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:06,410
Will Shutetsu be able to score their third goal?

74
00:05:06,410 --> 00:05:07,660
I'll never allow it!

75
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,540
Wait, instead of shooting, did he pass?

76
00:05:11,540 --> 00:05:14,330
Izawa-kun is running towards it!

77
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:18,130
The goalkeeper is reaching but won't make it!

78
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:20,340
Misaki-kun!

79
00:05:20,340 --> 00:05:21,170
He blocked it!

80
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:23,170
Misaki-kun put on a wonderful display!

81
00:05:23,170 --> 00:05:24,670
Amazing, Misaki!

82
00:05:26,050 --> 00:05:28,470
He... When did he get there?

83
00:05:28,470 --> 00:05:30,390
Now it's our turn to attack!

84
00:05:30,390 --> 00:05:31,510
Guys, stop them!

85
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:39,650
Misaki-kun is dribbling wonderfully, reminiscent of Tsubasa-kun!

86
00:05:39,650 --> 00:05:41,190
I'll score a goal too!

87
00:05:41,190 --> 00:05:42,230
You can't get past me!

88
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,030
He got past easily!

89
00:05:45,030 --> 00:05:47,110
Because he entered in extra time...

90
00:05:47,110 --> 00:05:48,110
...his energy is full!

91
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:50,320
He dribbles so well.

92
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:52,620
We definitely aren't a match for him.

93
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:58,370
Look at that Taro. I thought he was late, but he was here?

94
00:05:58,830 --> 00:06:00,790
Less than 3 minutes left!

95
00:06:00,790 --> 00:06:04,630
Nankatsu needs to take advantage of this chance!

96
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:07,550
He got past another one!

97
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:09,550
Misaki-kun is running circles around everyone!

98
00:06:09,550 --> 00:06:12,560
But there's also Tsubasa-kun approaching from the other wing!

99
00:06:12,850 --> 00:06:13,640
Come on!

100
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,430
Push, Nankatsu!

101
00:06:15,890 --> 00:06:18,940
Genzo, this is your final battle.

102
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:21,400
I'm counting on you, Tsubasa, Misaki!

103
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:24,400
Goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun is standing tall!

104
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:28,400
Will it be Tsubasa-kun or Misaki-kun shooting?

105
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:29,700
Stop them!

106
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:31,740
Shutetsu's defense has arrived!

107
00:06:31,740 --> 00:06:32,780
Tsubasa-kun!

108
00:06:32,780 --> 00:06:36,000
He's crossing to the open space for Misaki-kun!

109
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,660
So you're the one at the final point, Tsubasa!

110
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:40,790
What?!

111
00:06:40,790 --> 00:06:43,960
Tsubasa-kun passed instead of shooting!

112
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:46,550
Misaki-kun jumps and heads it there!

113
00:06:47,170 --> 00:06:48,970
I won't allow it!

114
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:50,550
Wakabayashi-kun's reaction is very fast.

115
00:06:51,930 --> 00:06:54,180
What? Is Misaki-kun passing again?

116
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:03,480
It went in! Goal!

117
00:07:05,110 --> 00:07:07,110
Equalizer!

118
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:10,570
Nankatsu has tied the score again.

119
00:07:10,570 --> 00:07:12,110
We did it!

120
00:07:13,030 --> 00:07:14,120
Tsubasa-kun!

121
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,290
We did it! We did it!

122
00:07:16,290 --> 00:07:18,120
Tsubasa-kun, nice shot.

123
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:20,540
Misaki-kun, nice assist.

124
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:24,710
A very beautiful duo play from Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun.

125
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:26,710
Amazing, Tsubasa-kun!

126
00:07:26,710 --> 00:07:28,260
Well done, Tsubasa!

127
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:29,470
Equalizer!

128
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:31,260
We did it, Coach!

129
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:31,930
Yes.

130
00:07:31,930 --> 00:07:34,430
You did it, Tsubasa-kun.

131
00:07:37,930 --> 00:07:39,020
Taro...

132
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:47,940
Genzo, you couldn't have stopped that.

133
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:52,530
Captain...

134
00:07:52,530 --> 00:07:54,780
We're sorry, Captain.

135
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:58,080
We couldn't hold them.

136
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:59,580
What are you saying?

137
00:08:00,790 --> 00:08:03,370
They haven't beaten us yet.

138
00:08:03,370 --> 00:08:04,790
Pull yourselves together!

139
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:05,920
Captain!

140
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,880
We still have time.

141
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,090
Let's give it our all!

142
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:10,460
Okay!

143
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,970
It's like a cat and mouse game.

144
00:08:13,970 --> 00:08:18,560
We can't predict how the game will end. Only 2 minutes left.

145
00:08:18,970 --> 00:08:22,270
We will definitely win. For our captain.

146
00:08:24,770 --> 00:08:25,690
Let's go!

147
00:08:25,690 --> 00:08:26,650
Yes!

148
00:08:26,650 --> 00:08:29,860
The match and the fierce battle continue!

149
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:31,650
Shutetsu is attacking!

150
00:08:31,650 --> 00:08:33,700
But Nankatsu got the ball!

151
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,990
Shutetsu got it back!

152
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:39,240
Both teams have been playing for over 45 minutes.

153
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,450
They have no energy left, but...

154
00:08:41,450 --> 00:08:45,040
...they are playing tirelessly with the will to win!

155
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:47,920
Less than one minute of the match remains!

156
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:51,090
There will be no more extra time.

157
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:52,970
Push, Nankatsu!

158
00:08:52,970 --> 00:08:54,970
Don't lose, Shutetsu!

159
00:08:54,970 --> 00:08:56,800
A cross came to Kisugi-kun.

160
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:01,310
But Nankatsu's defense has surrounded him!

161
00:09:01,310 --> 00:09:02,140
Damn it!

162
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,770
A ground shot!

163
00:09:04,230 --> 00:09:07,020
It went towards the goalkeeper!

164
00:09:07,310 --> 00:09:08,980
After collecting the ball, a long pass was made.

165
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,400
Takasugi! Stop that!

166
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:14,860
Takasugi-kun slides and steals the ball!

167
00:09:14,860 --> 00:09:16,450
Alright, time to attack.

168
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:19,240
Misaki-kun stole the ball!

169
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:22,240
But it's the final moments of the match!

170
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:23,750
Tsubasa-kun!

171
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:25,710
Alright!

172
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,580
The referee is looking at his watch!

173
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:29,590
Leave it to me!

174
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:34,670
Wakabayashi-kun and Tsubasa-kun are moving towards the ball!

175
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:36,340
Tsubasa!

176
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,850
Captain!

177
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:44,350
Wakabayashi-kun and Tsubasa-kun jumped at the same time!

178
00:09:44,350 --> 00:09:48,020
Their final confrontation!

179
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:11,340
N-No goal!

180
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:17,510
That's it! The whistle ending the match!

181
00:10:17,510 --> 00:10:23,100
After a 50-minute match without a winning goal...

182
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:26,600
...a match ending in a draw!

183
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:33,330
The 26th interschool tournament ends in a draw for the second time in history!

184
00:10:41,490 --> 00:10:43,580
You beat me, Tsubasa.

185
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:45,040
It's a draw.

186
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:47,710
Tsubasa!

187
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:49,710
Genzo!

188
00:10:54,210 --> 00:10:56,590
It's over.

189
00:10:56,590 --> 00:11:01,260
As soon as the match ended, a sudden pain seized my body.

190
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:02,850
Mine too.

191
00:11:02,850 --> 00:11:05,640
It's like I lost all my strength.

192
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:08,310
Nankatsu, it was a good match.

193
00:11:08,810 --> 00:11:11,480
We didn't think you'd play this well.

194
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,440
You've changed our opinion.

195
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:17,570
You did a great job.

196
00:11:17,570 --> 00:11:20,200
That's what you'd expect from Japan's best, Shutetsu!

197
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,820
You also did a great job, Nankatsu!

198
00:11:21,820 --> 00:11:26,580
No one will call you a lousy soccer club anymore!

199
00:11:30,370 --> 00:11:35,420
Tsubasa, let's meet on the field again.

200
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:36,500
Yes.

201
00:11:42,430 --> 00:11:44,140
Thank you for your cheers today.

202
00:11:47,060 --> 00:11:48,720
Tsubasa-kun...

203
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:52,690
Anego...

204
00:11:53,190 --> 00:11:56,610
Tsubasa, that was a beautiful game.

205
00:11:56,610 --> 00:11:57,570
Yes.

206
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:01,070
But this is just the beginning.

207
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:05,450
Your football career has just begun.

208
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:25,340
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

209
00:12:31,390 --> 00:12:33,140
Good morning, Roberto.

210
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:34,600
Good morning.

211
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:37,770
What? Where's Tsubasa?

212
00:12:37,770 --> 00:12:40,780
Isn't it obvious? He went to play soccer again.

213
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:44,450
The interschool tournament just ended, but...

214
00:12:44,450 --> 00:12:45,780
Oh, that kid...

215
00:12:50,290 --> 00:12:51,450
Alright.

216
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:53,040
Not yet.

217
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:55,710
I can't believe these two can still keep going.

218
00:12:55,710 --> 00:12:56,830
Exactly.

219
00:12:56,830 --> 00:13:00,550
I literally ran out of water in the interschool tournament.

220
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:04,050
Which one is better, I wonder?

221
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:06,970
Their dribbling skills seem equal, but...

222
00:13:06,970 --> 00:13:09,640
...I think Tsubasa's shots are better.

223
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:11,060
You're right.

224
00:13:11,060 --> 00:13:13,730
Now Misaki-kun's shot from Nankatsu is coming!

225
00:13:17,060 --> 00:13:19,730
Do you still think the same?

226
00:13:19,730 --> 00:13:22,740
Still, as long as those two are with us...

227
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:24,780
...the national tournament won't be a dream.

228
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:28,240
Yes. Let's beat Shutetsu in the regional tournament...

229
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,780
...and advance to the nationals!

230
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:31,540
That's impossible.

231
00:13:32,790 --> 00:13:34,660
Ishizaki!

232
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:35,460
Hey!

233
00:13:35,460 --> 00:13:37,080
Why is it impossible?!

234
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,140
This is Ishizaki-kun.

235
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,540
Yes. We tied in the interschool tournament, you know!

236
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:43,590
I'm not saying we can't beat Shutetsu.

237
00:13:43,590 --> 00:13:48,300
But Nankatsu city has decided to select a local team.

238
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:49,930
A local team?

239
00:13:49,930 --> 00:13:50,930
What's that?

240
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:52,390
Hey, Tsubasa.

241
00:13:52,890 --> 00:13:57,520
Until now, schools participated individually in the regional qualifiers, but...

242
00:13:57,520 --> 00:14:01,980
...this year, Nankatsu city has decided to gather the best from each school...

243
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:05,360
...and establish the Nankatsu Youth Soccer Club to represent the city.

244
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,780
The level for the national tournament is...

245
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:12,120
...already rising because other cities are fielding their own city clubs.

246
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:16,040
So we'll be teaming up with Shutetsu players?

247
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,790
Yes. If you want to participate in the nationals...

248
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:21,790
...you must first pass the city qualifiers.

249
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:24,050
There will be a selection soon.

250
00:14:24,050 --> 00:14:25,380
Selection?

251
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:28,720
Alright! I will do my best to pass too!

252
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:31,010
There's no way they'd pick you, Manabu.

253
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:32,260
You can't even be a substitute.

254
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:33,680
Not at all!

255
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,640
We tied against Shutetsu.

256
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,600
I can succeed too!

257
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:39,230
Yes, if we practice well, we can somehow succeed!

258
00:14:39,230 --> 00:14:43,070
Alright! Let's start training for the selections!

259
00:14:43,070 --> 00:14:44,650
Okay!

260
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:50,200
They gained a lot of confidence after the interschool tournament.

261
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,530
Me too.

262
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:55,490
So what will you do, Roberto?

263
00:14:55,490 --> 00:14:58,790
I'm thinking of returning to Brazil.

264
00:14:58,790 --> 00:15:00,370
Is that so?

265
00:15:00,370 --> 00:15:01,500
What will you do next?

266
00:15:01,500 --> 00:15:04,340
Don't worry about me, Captain.

267
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:06,590
Something like that won't happen again.

268
00:15:06,590 --> 00:15:07,920
Something like that?

269
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:09,720
Actually...

270
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:13,470
I was talking about when I met the Captain.

271
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:22,810
I'm embarrassed to say it, but when the doctor told me to quit football...

272
00:15:22,810 --> 00:15:25,900
...I was living as an aimless and lousy drunk.

273
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:32,910
If I can't play football, the game I gave my whole life to...

274
00:15:32,910 --> 00:15:34,580
...I thought I might as well die sooner or later.

275
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:39,460
What?! Someone jumped just now!

276
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:40,460
What?!

277
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:41,120
Nonsense!

278
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,580
How can he do that?!

279
00:15:43,830 --> 00:15:46,590
The person who saved me there was the Captain.

280
00:15:46,590 --> 00:15:51,880
And he also showed me to the best eye doctor in the world.

281
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:54,260
Though the results weren't very good.

282
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:58,720
You must have felt terrible devoting your whole life to football.

283
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,850
Though not as much as Tsubasa.

284
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:07,860
It may sound absurd coming from a troublemaker like me, but...

285
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:10,990
...I have one more request from you.

286
00:16:10,990 --> 00:16:13,030
A request?

287
00:16:16,450 --> 00:16:17,790
Well done, Genzo.

288
00:16:17,790 --> 00:16:19,330
That's enough for today.

289
00:16:19,330 --> 00:16:21,830
Mikami-san, I can still continue.

290
00:16:21,830 --> 00:16:24,830
Tsubasa and the others are probably still practicing.

291
00:16:24,830 --> 00:16:28,340
The wounds from the interschool tournament haven't healed yet.

292
00:16:28,340 --> 00:16:30,170
You shouldn't push yourself too hard.

293
00:16:30,170 --> 00:16:31,380
Okay.

294
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:35,220
Young master! Young master!

295
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:38,260
There's a delivery!

296
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:47,690
Genzo, is there something in the magazine that caught your eye?

297
00:16:47,690 --> 00:16:50,570
Mikami-san, I'm going out for a bit.

298
00:16:50,570 --> 00:16:51,780
Alright, I'm starting.

299
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:52,990
Get a hold of yourselves!

300
00:16:52,990 --> 00:16:54,700
It went there!

301
00:16:54,700 --> 00:16:56,070
Damn it!

302
00:16:56,070 --> 00:16:59,450
I want to practice too.

303
00:16:59,450 --> 00:17:02,200
Just heal up already.

304
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,750
That hurts!

305
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:06,000
What?

306
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:09,000
Wakabayashi!

307
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:12,260
I wanted to beat you this time, but...

308
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:14,510
...there are going to be city team selections.

309
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:16,010
Unfortunately now--

310
00:17:16,010 --> 00:17:18,600
Never mind that, where is Roberto Hongo?!

311
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:21,100
What a threatening glare.

312
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:23,140
The coach didn't come today.

313
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:26,400
Do you know about his eyes?

314
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,150
What?

315
00:17:27,150 --> 00:17:29,110
What are you talking about?

316
00:17:29,110 --> 00:17:30,980
Don't you know?!

317
00:17:32,610 --> 00:17:35,820
Roberto Hongo can't play football anymore!

318
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:36,740
What?

319
00:17:36,740 --> 00:17:38,240
Roberto...

320
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:40,120
Look at this.

321
00:17:41,370 --> 00:17:43,370
Retired?!

322
00:17:43,370 --> 00:17:45,460
Why is the Coach retiring?

323
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:47,420
He was diagnosed with a detached retina.

324
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:49,500
But he can play with us.

325
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:52,420
Don't confuse elementary school football with professional football!

326
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:57,390
Even if he can play with you, he can no longer step onto the field with professionals!

327
00:17:57,930 --> 00:17:59,890
Roberto...

328
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,890
Tsubasa!

329
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:04,390
I'll ask Roberto personally!

330
00:18:06,600 --> 00:18:09,560
Alright, we're coming too!

331
00:18:12,070 --> 00:18:13,820
Roberto is retiring?

332
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:18,320
Be friends with the ball.

333
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:21,080
He can no longer play football...

334
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:23,240
What?

335
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,160
I beg of you, Captain!

336
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,660
And you too, mother!

337
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:31,840
I will definitely make Tsubasa a world-class footballer!

338
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:32,460
Therefore...

339
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:33,500
Roberto!

340
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:36,760
Therefore, please let me take Tsubasa to Brazil!

341
00:18:39,010 --> 00:18:40,220
Tsubasa!

342
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:47,140
Roberto... Is it true you can no longer play football?

343
00:18:47,140 --> 00:18:48,390
Yes.

344
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:50,770
Can you really not play football anymore?

345
00:18:50,770 --> 00:18:52,150
Yes.

346
00:18:52,150 --> 00:18:55,530
I can no longer take my place on the football field.

347
00:19:00,410 --> 00:19:04,410
Roberto, isn't Brazil the country of football?

348
00:19:05,290 --> 00:19:06,580
Exactly!

349
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:11,170
All its citizens love football and live and breathe it.

350
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:15,550
Roberto, I'll come to Brazil too.

351
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,170
Tsubasa...

352
00:19:19,590 --> 00:19:23,680
Then we must play football from the heart from now on.

353
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:30,900
Yes, exactly. Let's do our best at the selections!

354
00:19:30,900 --> 00:19:33,940
We'll pass and play with Tsubasa in the nationals!

355
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:35,570
Yes.

356
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:47,330
And the day of the Nankatsu Youth Soccer Club selections had come.

357
00:19:48,410 --> 00:19:52,120
The selections will be held in match format.

358
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:57,420
Coach Shiroyama and his team will observe and evaluate everyone for 5 minutes.

359
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:06,810
Wakabayashi and the Shutetsu quartet had already proven their talent.

360
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:11,480
At this rate, all the players will come from Shutetsu.

361
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:13,400
Don't decide so quickly.

362
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,610
There are still many players.

363
00:20:15,610 --> 00:20:18,820
There could be players better than those from Shutetsu.

364
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:22,610
Tsubasa-kun!

365
00:20:30,710 --> 00:20:32,330
A volley in the air!

366
00:20:32,330 --> 00:20:34,330
This isn't something at the elementary school level!

367
00:20:34,330 --> 00:20:36,090
Damn it! Tsubasa will be selected!

368
00:20:36,090 --> 00:20:37,420
Amazing!

369
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:40,050
I've decided on our team's center forward.

370
00:20:40,050 --> 00:20:41,630
Roberto!

371
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:45,640
I will win the national tournaments and go to Brazil!

372
00:20:46,100 --> 00:20:47,970
Tsubasa...

373
00:20:48,350 --> 00:20:49,350
Kids.

374
00:20:49,350 --> 00:20:52,770
All of you did your best today.

375
00:20:52,770 --> 00:20:55,480
The coach who watched your dedicated play--

376
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:58,650
Skip the story and announce the selected ones!

377
00:20:58,650 --> 00:21:00,150
Exactly!

378
00:21:00,150 --> 00:21:02,150
I am the mayor...

379
00:21:02,820 --> 00:21:04,410
Here are the selection results.

380
00:21:04,410 --> 00:21:09,240
From Shutetsu, Wakabayashi and the Shutetsu quartet.

381
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:13,500
From Nishigaoka, Urabe. From Yamabuki, Kishida.

382
00:21:13,500 --> 00:21:19,170
And from Nankatsu, Tsubasa, Misaki, and Ishizaki.

383
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:22,340
I did it.

384
00:21:22,340 --> 00:21:25,890
Tsubasa, this time we'll fight on the same team.

385
00:21:25,890 --> 00:21:26,840
I can't wait.

386
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:28,720
Yes.

387
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:32,100
50, 51, 52, 53...

388
00:21:36,270 --> 00:21:38,400
Tsubasa will be taken care of by Roberto.

389
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:44,070
It truly is better for Tsubasa to play in Brazil.

390
00:21:44,070 --> 00:21:45,650
We may suffer a bit of loneliness, but...

391
00:21:45,650 --> 00:21:48,490
...families shouldn't hinder their children's dreams.

392
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,370
You're right.

393
00:21:51,370 --> 00:21:53,680
Instead of being stuck in Japan for Tsubasa...

394
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:56,330
...it's better to be on Brazil's vast lands.

395
00:21:56,330 --> 00:22:00,250
Yes. Never give up, Tsubasa.

396
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:02,670
99, 100!

397
00:22:02,670 --> 00:22:04,670
Roberto, I juggled 100 times.

398
00:22:04,670 --> 00:22:08,760
Alright. Now juggle 200 times using your head and knee.

399
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:09,890
Okay!

400
00:22:11,430 --> 00:22:14,730
1, 2, 3, 4...

402
00:23:50,110 --> 00:24:00,460
Next Episode 10: Kojiro Arrives